er there.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le18ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What did you find?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you want one that turns off automatically, this one will.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you needed a digital one that also warmed food up, you should get this one.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This cooker will turn on remotely if you program it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are you going to use it a lot? Are you planning on cooking a lot of rice? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm trying out different dishes this weekend, so I'll need to cook a few cups. Maybe 10.", "id": 2, "time": "22000", "image": "2engenn7le18ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you cook different types, this one has three separate baskets. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That would be good if they were all the same size.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm ... Yes, they are.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow. I see. You pour in the water, and cook up the rice. Nice! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Then you dish it out and ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mix in some vegetables and fry it up.", "id": 3, "time": "50000", "image": "engenn7le18ob06re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Rice Cookout"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Chef Heaven"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Phrasal Verbs about Cooking"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use phrasal verbs when you talk about cooking or when you are cooking. Phrasal verbs are informal verbs so they fit well into conversations about cooking and cooking activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you add a particle (preposition) to a verb, it becomes a phrasal verb. The verb changes and has a different meaning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Phrasal Verb Form:<br/>verb + particle (preposition)<br/><span class=\"italic\">turn</span>    +  <span class=\"italic\">off </span>     =  stop the operation of<br/><span class=\"italic\">warm</span>  + <span class=\"italic\">up</span>       =  reheat; make hot again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some phrasal verbs are separating. This means the verb and particle can stay together or they can be separated by a noun or pronoun."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a noun it can go between the verb and particle, or after the verb and particle."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Let's warm up the leftovers.<br/>Let's warm the leftovers up.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a pronoun it can only go between the verb and particle."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Let's warm them up.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "This digital one also warms food up."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You pour in the water, and cook up the rice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then you dish it out."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Mix in some vegetables and fry it up."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm trying out different dishes this weekend."}, {"type": "example", "content": "There's a digital one that also warms food up."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This cooker turns on remotely."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This one turns off automatically."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future with <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, the Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use three different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about  things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'll start over there.</p><p>I won't pay that much.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p>I decide now to start there.</p><p>I decide now that I don't want to pay that much.</p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'm going to start here.</p><p>Are you going to use it a lot?</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p>I intend to start here.</p><p>Is it your intention to use it a lot?</p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'm trying out different dishes this weekend.</p><p>Are you cooking a lot of rice this weekend?</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p>This is my plan for the weekend.</p><p>Is this on your agenda for the weekend?</p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to warm up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make hotter"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This one can warm up cold food too!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about kitchen appliances."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to turn on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to start"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You turn on the cooker here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to turn off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stop"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It has an automatic turn off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remotely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "from a distance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can start the cooker remotely."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to try out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to experiment with something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm trying out different dishes this weekend."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pour in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put liquid into"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: First, you pour in the water."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "specification"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a detailed description"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have to look at the specifications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mix in"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to combine with other things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mix in some vegetables."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cook with oil in a pan"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fry up the potatoes in this pan."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le18ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Decide  what you want to have for dinner tonight and write up a list of food you need."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write sentences about making the dinner using phrasal verbs (<span class=\"italic\">turn on</span>, <span class=\"italic\">cook up</span>, <span class=\"italic\">mix in</span>, etc.)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about future action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I  talk about making food using phrasal verbs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my dinner and how to make it with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}